            "sid": "ISA 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua Yehowa neafuile Yakoba luse, neasungule ba mu Bena Isalele bu bantu bandi kabidi, ne neabashikike mu buloba buabo bua diambedi. Bantu ba bende nebadisangishe nʼabo, nebadilamike kudi ba mu bana ba Yakoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba mu bisamba bia ba bende nebabangate, nebabafile ku muaba wabo. Ba mu Bena Isalele nebadiangatshile bantu aba bu buhianyi buabo mu buloba bua Yehowa bua kuikalabo bahika babo balume ne bahika babo bakashi. Nunku nebabueshe bantu aba mu buhika bakadi bababuesha mu buhika diambedi, ne nebakokeshe ku mutu kua bakadi babakengesha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
